    <div>
      <p begin="00:13.420" end="00:16.710" ttm:agent="v1">Metro, Metro, Metro, sheesh</p>
      <p begin="00:16.710" end="00:19.130" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ayy)</p>
      <p begin="00:19.130" end="00:23.390" ttm:agent="v1">Metro, Metro</p>
      <p begin="00:23.390" end="00:26.260" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Never need a bitch, I'm what a bitch need (bitch need)</p>
      <p begin="00:26.260" end="00:28.920" ttm:agent="v1">Tryna find the one that can fix me</p>
      <p begin="00:28.920" end="00:31.230" ttm:agent="v1">I've been dodgin' death in the six speed</p>
      <p begin="00:31.230" end="00:35.060" ttm:agent="v1">Amphetamine got my stummy feelin' sickly</p>
      <p begin="00:35.060" end="00:37.000" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, I want it all now</p>
      <p begin="00:37.000" end="00:39.910" ttm:agent="v1">I've been runnin' through the pussy, need a dog pound</p>
      <p begin="00:39.910" end="00:42.740" ttm:agent="v1">Hundred models gettin' faded in the compound</p>
      <p begin="00:42.740" end="00:46.100" ttm:agent="v1">Tryna love me, but they never get a pulse down</p>
      <p begin="00:46.100" end="00:48.440" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Why?) 'Cause I'm heartless</p>
      <p begin="00:48.440" end="00:51.120" ttm:agent="v1">And I'm back to my ways 'cause I'm heartless</p>
      <p begin="00:51.120" end="00:54.070" ttm:agent="v1">All this money and this pain got me heartless</p>
      <p begin="00:54.070" end="00:58.210" ttm:agent="v1">Low life for life 'cause I'm heartless</p>
      <p begin="00:58.210" end="00:59.710" ttm:agent="v1">Said I'm heartless</p>
      <p begin="00:59.630" end="01:02.420" ttm:agent="v1">Tryna be a better man but I'm heartless</p>
      <p begin="01:02.420" end="01:05.430" ttm:agent="v1">Never be a weddin' plan for the heartless</p>
      <p begin="01:05.430" end="01:09.510" ttm:agent="v1">Low life for life 'cause I'm heartless</p>
