      <p begin="01:16.500" end="01:20.080" ttm:agent="v1">Tesla pill got me flyin' like a cockpit</p>
      <p begin="01:20.080" end="01:22.380" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, I got her watchin'</p>
      <p begin="01:22.380" end="01:25.050" ttm:agent="v1">Call me up, turn that pussy to a faucet</p>
      <p begin="01:25.050" end="01:27.840" ttm:agent="v1">Duffle bags full of drugs and a rocket</p>
      <p begin="01:27.840" end="01:31.290" ttm:agent="v1">Stix drunk, but he never miss a target</p>
      <p begin="01:31.290" end="01:33.440" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Photoshoots, I'm a star now (star)</p>
      <p begin="01:33.440" end="01:36.310" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I'm talkin' Time, Rolling Stone, and Bazaar now (Bazaar now)</p>
      <p begin="01:36.310" end="01:39.190" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Sellin' dreams to these girls with their guard down (what?)</p>
      <p begin="01:39.190" end="01:42.650" ttm:agent="v1">Seven years, I've been swimmin' with the sharks now</p>
      <p begin="01:42.650" end="01:44.820" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Why?) 'Cause I'm heartless</p>
      <p begin="01:44.820" end="01:47.620" ttm:agent="v1">And I'm back to my ways 'cause I'm heartless</p>
      <p begin="01:47.620" end="01:50.440" ttm:agent="v1">All this money and this pain got me heartless</p>
      <p begin="01:50.440" end="01:54.680" ttm:agent="v1">Low life for life 'cause I'm heartless</p>
