      <p begin="01:58.980" end="02:01.840" ttm:agent="v1">Never be a weddin' plan for the heartless</p>
      <p begin="02:01.840" end="02:07.140" ttm:agent="v1">Low life for life 'cause I'm heartless</p>
      <p begin="02:07.140" end="02:12.700" ttm:agent="v1">I lost my heart and my mind</p>
      <p begin="02:12.700" end="02:18.490" ttm:agent="v1">I try to always do right</p>
      <p begin="02:18.490" end="02:23.860" ttm:agent="v1">I thought I lost you this time</p>
